title: "model-audit-lite"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nakatsugawa
    given-names: Masahiro
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3224-0103"
abstract: >-
  Lightweight safety audit for Hugging Face models: file-distribution audit (pickle formats,
  bundled code, SHA-256 of every file), conversion-integrity diff (chat template including
  GGUF metadata, safety-probe regressions with statistics), CycloneDX ML-BOM output, and a
  small known-pattern prompt-injection probe suite.
